			<div class="content" id="post-content-1450723">
									

<p>I think there's something here. I think the writing could use some tightening up in the description area; maybe move the paragraph that describes her anomalous properties up one so that it's not buried.</p>
<p>The part that I like is the Foundation chopping off pieces of this old lady and attempting to buy things. However, there's a little too much humor in it for a straight SCP. They're taking chunks of skin off this person, here.</p>
<p>Also, the &quot;I have a coupon&quot; line is kind of funny, but again a little off for the tone. Maybe if there was a description of how deranged someone would be that's lived a long time by cutting bits off themselves to survive, it would fit better. Or it might be easier just to edit out the &quot;LOL OLD PEOPLE&quot; moment.</p>

